Package: checkoutab
Title: A/B Test of a One-Page Checkout
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Mohammad", "Haghjoo", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Design, analysis and decision for an online-shop checkout experiment:
    power analysis, sample ratio check, frequentist and Bayesian estimates,
    CUPED variance reduction, segment effects and the cost of peeking.
